//api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/deployments","created_at":"2012-12-07T13:30:23Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T11:48:01Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-11T20:11:30Z","git_url":"git://github.com/python/mypy.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:python/mypy.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/python/mypy.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/python/mypy","homepage":"https://www.mypy-lang.org/","size":77161,"stargazers_count":20064,"watchers_count":20064,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":3065,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":3124,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["linter","python","typechecker","types","typing"],"visibility":"public","forks":3065,"open_issues":3124,"watchers":20064,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Minimum repro:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nobject(*[])\r\nobject(**{})\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis gives the following errors:\r\n\r\n```\r\nToo many arguments for \"object\"\r\nToo many arguments for \"object\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nI think this is valid code and should pass the type check.\r\n\r\nContext: I encountered this when I tried to write a multiple inheritance model where each class is passing arguments to the next parent (in terms of MRO):\r\n\r\n```python\r\nclass A(object):\r\n    def __init__(self, a_arg: int, **kwds: Any) -> None:\r\n        super().__init__(**kwds)\r\n\r\nclass B(object):\r\n    def __init__(self, b_arg: int, **kwds: Any) -> None:\r\n        super().__init__(**kwds)\r\n\r\nclass C(A, B):\r\n    def __init__(self, c_arg: int, **kwds: Any) -> None:\r\n        super().__init__(**kwds)\r\n\r\nC(a_arg=1, b_arg=2, c_arg=3)\r\n\r\n# This code runs fine but gives three type errors saying:\r\n#     Too many arguments for \"__init__\" of \"object\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou cannot expect a static derivation order due to the dynamic nature of MRO, so it's hard to avoid this error from happening.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/4001/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/4001/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"momohatt","id":28808615,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4ODA4NjE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28808615?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/momohatt","html_url":"https://github.com/momohatt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/momohatt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/momohatt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/momohatt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/momohatt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/momohatt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/momohatt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/momohatt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/momohatt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/momohatt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-23T08:44:33Z","updated_at":"2020-10-23T08:44:33Z","source":{"type":"issue","issue":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/9629","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/9629/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/9629/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/rep